  "readme": [
    {
      "section": "xby-hnews",
      "text": "DeepSeek Harness (DSH) 的插件：Hacker新闻数据服务\n\n一个提供从Hacker News获取信息的工具集，包括获取故事、评论、用户信息和搜索故事等功能。"
    },
    {
      "section": "功能",
      "text": "- **set_xby_apikey** — 在聊天中设置 API 密钥（自动持久化，重启有效）\n- **get_stories** — Get stories from Hacker News. The options are `top`, `new`, `ask_hn`, `show_hn` for types of stories. This doesn't include the comments. Use `get_story_info` to get the comments.\n- **get_user_info** — Get user info from Hacker News, including the stories they've submitted\n- **search_stories** — Search stories from Hacker News. It is generally recommended to use simpler queries to get a broader set of results (less than 5 words). Very targetted queries may not return any results.\n- **get_story_info** — Get detailed story info from Hacker News, including the comments"
    },
    {
      "section": "方式一：从 GitHub 直接安装（推荐）",
      "text": "```bash"
    },
    {
      "section": "格式: dsh plugin --profile <profile> add github:<owner>/<repo>",
      "text": "dsh plugin --profile web add github:xby_skill/xby-hnews\n```"
    },
    {
      "section": "方式二：从本地目录安装（开发模式）",
      "text": "```bash"
    },
    {
      "section": "仅用于本地开发调试",
      "text": "dsh plugin --profile web add /absolute/path/to/xby-hnews\n```"
    },
    {
      "section": "方式三：通过 cordis.patch.yml 开发调试",
      "text": "```bash\ndsh web --profile web --patch /absolute/path/to/dsh-ocr-plugin/cordis.patch.yml\n```"
    },
    {
      "section": "获取 API 密钥",
      "text": "前往 [小笨羊官网](https://xiaobenyang.com) 注册并获取 API 密钥。"
    }
  ],
